1
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:12,280
" THEY SEE YOU FROM WHERE YOU CANNOT SEE THEM "

2
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:15,840
You 're in a dream , Tarik . Wake up !

3
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:17,760
Wake up !

4
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:22,760
Wake up !

5
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:32,880
Soul becomes a stone .

6
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:40,000
Unless my mask is removed from the dirt , loneliness surrounding the earth

7
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:43,240
will be decorated with your apocalypse .

8
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:48,080
The dead gave life to your shadow . Tell me who you are .

9
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:28,480
He 's not answering the phone , Sema ?

10
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:32,520
He 's not answering .

11
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:37,160
He had a thing on the Internet . Maybe he 's still working on it .

12
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:41,240
It 's been days and I 'm not getting any news from him . It bothers me .

13
00:03:41,320 --> 00:03:43,520
Well , I understand why he didn 't come here ,

14
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,560
but it 's silly not to answer the phone .

15
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:48,440
Girl , you 're so weird .

16
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:53,600
He asked you out and you said no . You told him to stay as friends .

17
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:57,000
Maybe not as much as yours , but men have pride , too .

18
00:03:57,880 --> 00:03:59,800
Of course he doesn 't answer the phone .

19
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:03,560
But we call him from work . How can he know that it is Sema ?

20
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:10,360
Well , I don 't know about that , but Tarik recently bought a new computer .

21
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:14,480
After Sema rejected him , he locked himself in his home , turned into a computer nerd .

22
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:19,560
He had called me four days ago in the middle of a night . I was shocked .

23
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:21,400
I asked him what happened .

24
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:26,320
After he waited for a moment in silence , he said there was nothing and he hung up .

25
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:31,120
I don 't think Tarik 's behavior is about you , Sema .

26
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:34,640
Because a few days earlier , he did the same to me .

27
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:40,480
Well , maybe you 'll be surprised , but he called me a week ago , too ,

28
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:46,560
and said something I couldn 't understand in a whispered tone and hung up the phone .

29
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:52,720
Well , to be honest ,

30
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:56,120
Tarik got very strange after moving to that cottage .

31
00:04:57,920 --> 00:05:00,000
It is so desolate at night .

32
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:03,680
I wouldn 't stay in that house even if they paid me .

33
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:07,000
You think he 's home now ?

34
00:06:37,880 --> 00:06:39,400
Tarik , are you home ?

35
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:42,840
Tarik ?

36
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:56,160
- Can you do it ? - Almost done , ma 'am .

37
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:58,240
Just a second .

38
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:05,960
It 's open . There you go .

39
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:13,760
- Thank you . - Thanks , have a good day .

40
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,960
What happened to this place ?

41
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:08,240
What is it with all these tapes ?

42
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:24,640
Were you here all along ? You scared me to death .

43
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:27,680
Sorry , Hande . I didn 't hear you come .

44
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:33,280
You 're fine , right ? We 've been worried when we didn 't hear from you for days .

45
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:35,680
Why didn 't you answer the phone ?

46
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:38,400
I was working , dealing with stuff .

47
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:41,520
Did you finish your work on the Internet ?

48
00:10:42,880 --> 00:10:44,320
No , I am not done .

49
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:49,920
You 've been working on it day and night for four days . What sort of work is this ?

50
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:53,400
- Can you tell me about it ? What is it ? - Never mind .

51
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:06,560
I just remembered , if you 're done with my camera , can I take it back ?

52
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,680
I 'm done , thanks .

53
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:11,480
It 's in the drawer right under the bookshelf .

54
00:11:20,800 --> 00:11:24,880
Tarik , do you want me to open the windows for fresh air ?

55
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:34,160
For God 's sake , what is it with all these papers and tapes ?

56
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,600
Everywhere is a mess .

57
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:41,760
If there 's something I can do , I 'm free .

58
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:04,960
You know what ? Sema is really worried about you .

59
00:12:06,400 --> 00:12:09,040
She thinks that you don 't call us just because of her .

60
00:12:11,040 --> 00:12:14,440
Maybe you shouldn 't give up on her so soon .

61
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:19,040
Do you know what I mean ?

62
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:20,880
Tarik ?

63
00:12:29,280 --> 00:12:30,200
Tarik ?

64
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:41,600
Tarik ?

65
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:46,800
Tarik ?

66
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:10,160
Wake up now .

67
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:15,160
Wake up . Wake up now .

68
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:17,840
Wake up .

69
00:13:18,880 --> 00:13:20,920
Wake up .

70
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:27,120
Wake up !

71
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:28,360
- Hello ? - Hello , Chief . It 's Haluk .

72
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:35,240
- Morning , Haluk . What happened ? - Maybe you should come a bit early today .

73
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:38,960
Station is under a lot of pressure now . A weird suicide happened yesterday .

74
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:42,120
HQ wants you to take care of this case .

75
00:15:43,280 --> 00:15:47,600
- HQ ? - We received a call from Ankara .

76
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:56,800
Tarik Poyraz . 23 years old .

77
00:15:56,880 --> 00:15:59,600
It looks like he killed himself with a big kitchen knife

78
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:02,800
at home at 4 : 40 p.m.

79
00:16:02,880 --> 00:16:08,840
Initial reports suggest that there is no traces of violence .

80
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:12,240
The fingerprint on the knife belongs to him .

81
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:16,920
It seems like people knew him well . He was well liked .

82
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:21,000
He was making money on the Internet with some stock market transactions .

83
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:24,080
They said that he had been withdrawn lately .

84
00:16:25,240 --> 00:16:28,800
The mess in his room shows us he had some psychological problems .

85
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:33,120
During the incident , he had a friend named Hande

86
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:36,160
who came to visit him at his home .

87
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:42,560
Both autopsy report and the girl tell us the same story . It 's suicide .

88
00:16:44,760 --> 00:16:46,240
But the cause is unknown .

89
00:16:50,760 --> 00:16:52,080
I 'm sorry , Chief .

90
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:57,200
Why is Ankara so interested in that case ?

91
00:16:57,800 --> 00:16:59,720
We don 't understand that either .

92
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:04,640
They told us that as these kinds of deaths increase , especially in Istanbul - -

93
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:09,080
Never mind . You mentioned a girl . What is her name ?

94
00:17:09,160 --> 00:17:11,520
Hande Çerkez . She is outside now .

95
00:17:24,760 --> 00:17:29,240
Ms. Çerkez , Detective Süleyman Derviş is the head of this case .

96
00:17:29,320 --> 00:17:31,760
He 'll ask you a few questions .

97
00:17:44,880 --> 00:17:50,000
Your friend has committed suicide . So we do not suspect a murder .

98
00:17:50,800 --> 00:17:57,360
From now , every detail you tell us will help us close the case . That 's all .

99
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:06,320
Miss Çerkez , can you please look at my face while I am talking ?

100
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:18,520
Why do you think your friend has committed suicide ?

101
00:18:19,840 --> 00:18:20,920
I don 't know .

102
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:26,440
Have you ever thought about why people kill themselves by jumping into the sea ?

103
00:18:30,040 --> 00:18:36,040
Because they see it as a soft , big pillow .

104
00:18:36,120 --> 00:18:38,840
Or a compassionate hug from their mothers .

105
00:18:40,040 --> 00:18:42,680
They believe they won 't feel any pain .

106
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:47,640
But the most terrible and painful way of death ...

107
00:18:48,280 --> 00:18:50,200
is by drowning .

108
00:18:52,960 --> 00:18:57,080
I mean , the way of suicide

109
00:18:57,520 --> 00:19:00,800
may give us more clues than the real reason .

110
00:19:01,760 --> 00:19:03,680
Just like your friend 's case .

111
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:07,600
It doesn 't look like a typical suicide , right ?

112
00:19:09,800 --> 00:19:13,600
Miss Çerkez , please look at my face while I am talking .

113
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:20,040
What happened in the house that day ?

114
00:19:21,760 --> 00:19:24,800
Did you finish your work on the Internet ?

115
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:26,800
No , I am not done .

116
00:19:27,800 --> 00:19:31,440
You 've been working on it day and night for four days . What sort of work is this ?

117
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:33,760
Can you tell me about it ? What is it ?

118
00:19:35,560 --> 00:19:36,800
Never mind !

119
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:49,240
I just remembered , if you 're done with my digital camera , can I take it back ?

120
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:52,280
I 'm done , thanks .

121
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:56,000
It 's in the drawer right under the bookshelf .

122
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:03,240
Wake up !

123
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:05,920
Wake up now !

124
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:09,600
Wake up !

125
00:20:15,120 --> 00:20:16,480
Wake up now !

126
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:24,200
Wake up now !

127
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:29,880
Wake up now !

128
00:20:32,160 --> 00:20:33,400
Wake up !

129
00:20:34,120 --> 00:20:37,840
Wake up !

130
00:20:38,640 --> 00:20:41,000
Wake up !

131
00:20:41,480 --> 00:20:43,840
Wake up !

132
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:13,640
You 're in a dream , Tarik !

133
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:16,720
Wake up !

134
00:21:17,920 --> 00:21:21,040
Wake up !

135
00:21:29,080 --> 00:21:30,920
Hande , what happened ?

136
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:33,360
I saw Tarik in my dream .

137
00:21:43,640 --> 00:21:47,360
Why did he kill himself in such a terrible way ?

138
00:21:49,240 --> 00:21:52,360
Guys , I don 't think one of us is guilty .

139
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:55,760
Suicide does not happen just like that .

140
00:21:57,280 --> 00:22:01,400
It 's a way of expressing secrets and pain .

141
00:22:03,640 --> 00:22:06,720
We thought that we knew him .

142
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:11,880
Last week , he told me that he wanted to travel to the Far East for a vacation .

143
00:22:13,120 --> 00:22:18,280
He was so normal . You know , sometimes you 're just lost in your thoughts ,

144
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:20,480
he wouldn 't even do that .

145
00:22:21,520 --> 00:22:27,760
Actually , this Internet thing made him into someone darker .

146
00:22:28,160 --> 00:22:32,120
I warned him all the time , " Stop working , go outside . "

147
00:22:34,040 --> 00:22:36,960
I wonder what the cops are thinking . What did you tell them ?

148
00:22:40,480 --> 00:22:45,440
Miss Çerkez , please look at my face while I am talking .

149
00:22:46,240 --> 00:22:48,360
What happened in the house that day ?

150
00:22:49,440 --> 00:22:51,880
We were chatting . It was normal .

151
00:22:52,800 --> 00:22:57,160
He just looked ... really tired .

152
00:22:57,560 --> 00:23:01,440
The whole place was covered in black tapes and newspapers .

153
00:23:03,560 --> 00:23:07,960
When he came near me , he opened the cabinet and took something .

154
00:23:09,000 --> 00:23:10,720
Then he went to his room .

155
00:23:12,400 --> 00:23:14,400
I asked him about my camera which I gave him .

156
00:23:14,480 --> 00:23:16,160
He said he 's finished with it .

157
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:24,880
After I took my camera , I heard him screaming horribly ...

158
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:26,720
" Wake up ! "

159
00:23:27,880 --> 00:23:29,720
- Then - - - I know what happened afterwards .

160
00:23:31,320 --> 00:23:35,600
Okay . I will ask you one last question . This one is important .

161
00:23:36,760 --> 00:23:38,280
As far as I understand ,

162
00:23:38,360 --> 00:23:41,160
Tarik was really interested in computers and the Internet .

163
00:23:42,080 --> 00:23:48,840
Do you think he might have anything to do with new religions or cults ?

164
00:23:49,640 --> 00:23:51,160
I 've known him for many years ,

165
00:23:51,240 --> 00:23:53,160
and I 've never heard of anything like that .

166
00:23:53,520 --> 00:23:55,800
He wasn 't interested in those kinds of things .

167
00:23:56,680 --> 00:24:00,080
He just earned money on the Internet .

168
00:24:04,120 --> 00:24:09,520
So you did not tell the cops that he got rejected by Sema four days ago ?

169
00:24:10,120 --> 00:24:11,520
Don 't be ridiculous , Cem .

170
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:13,720
You were the one saying

171
00:24:14,080 --> 00:24:17,440
that it cannot be related to Tarik 's suicide .

172
00:24:17,680 --> 00:24:19,520
All right , don 't get mad !

173
00:24:20,480 --> 00:24:22,400
I 'm just worried .

174
00:24:23,400 --> 00:24:27,440
And only a fool would go to the police to report this .

175
00:24:29,520 --> 00:24:33,360
Never mind . Tarik didn 't have much luck with women anyways .

176
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:36,200
He was almost incompetent .

177
00:24:38,440 --> 00:24:41,800
Buddy ... I still can 't believe it .

178
00:26:25,440 --> 00:26:29,680
It isn 't me .

179
00:26:30,320 --> 00:26:34,440
No !

180
00:26:58,080 --> 00:27:01,560
It isn 't me .

181
00:27:08,760 --> 00:27:12,360
You are not real !

182
00:27:15,240 --> 00:27:17,160
You don 't exist !

183
00:27:21,400 --> 00:27:24,840
Go away ! You can 't come in !

184
00:27:29,000 --> 00:27:30,560
You can 't come in ! Go away !

185
00:27:30,640 --> 00:27:32,040
Get out .

186
00:27:32,120 --> 00:27:35,200
Where are you ?

187
00:28:01,480 --> 00:28:04,160
This is what separates humankind from others .

188
00:28:04,920 --> 00:28:07,480
We forget death easily .

189
00:28:08,760 --> 00:28:10,440
And that is the right thing .

190
00:28:11,640 --> 00:28:15,440
Now that I think of it , many people from my childhood are dead now .

191
00:28:16,160 --> 00:28:18,200
I cried after each .

192
00:28:19,320 --> 00:28:21,320
Especially after my wife .

193
00:28:22,600 --> 00:28:26,560
But after a short time , your grief disappears .

194
00:28:28,160 --> 00:28:33,040
- That 's life ! We need to be strong ! - Hello , how are you , uncle ?

195
00:28:33,120 --> 00:28:36,240
Thank you . Welcome . We were chatting with Sema .

196
00:28:36,640 --> 00:28:39,800
- How are you ? - Good . My mother called me .

197
00:28:39,880 --> 00:28:43,520
" You can come back to Istanbul , " she said . I told her that I 'd stay for a while .

198
00:28:43,600 --> 00:28:47,640
It 's good idea . We need each other at these times , anyways .

199
00:28:47,720 --> 00:28:51,040
When we 're done with this stuff , we can go sailing with my uncle 's boat .

200
00:28:51,440 --> 00:28:55,680
We can go to the island that I told you about before .

201
00:28:55,760 --> 00:28:56,600
Girls .

202
00:28:58,920 --> 00:29:00,640
Ready to see something really weird ?

203
00:29:00,720 --> 00:29:02,200
- What ? - What sort of ...

204
00:29:02,600 --> 00:29:04,480
I was checking my emails .

205
00:29:06,360 --> 00:29:09,040
I think you 'll find one of them interesting .

206
00:29:15,040 --> 00:29:18,600
- What ? What is that ? - Wait a minute .

207
00:29:20,480 --> 00:29:25,200
Look at the mail at the top . The one with " 388 @ 0 . "

208
00:29:28,200 --> 00:29:31,880
- Yes ! This is Tarik 's address . - And the delivery date is today .

209
00:29:31,960 --> 00:29:34,400
LET ME OUT !

210
00:29:36,080 --> 00:29:40,520
How does a man who died three days ago send an e-mail ten minutes ago ?

211
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:43,440
What does it say ? Open it !

212
00:29:46,040 --> 00:29:47,800
This is the most interesting part .

213
00:29:47,880 --> 00:29:51,280
A weird picture attached next to the writing " Let me out . "

214
00:29:55,320 --> 00:29:56,640
It is Tarik .

215
00:30:01,480 --> 00:30:03,120
Did you look carefully at that part ?

216
00:30:04,080 --> 00:30:05,080
What is that ?

217
00:30:06,160 --> 00:30:07,360
Look carefully .

218
00:30:10,880 --> 00:30:13,880
- Do you see it ? - His pupils don 't exist .

219
00:30:13,960 --> 00:30:18,080
- How could this be possible ? - What are those in the background ? Humans ?

220
00:30:19,480 --> 00:30:22,080
Really , what are those ? What are they doing ?

221
00:30:22,480 --> 00:30:25,920
- Make it bigger . Hurry up ! - All right , don 't panic .

222
00:30:31,560 --> 00:30:33,560
Who took this photo ?

223
00:30:34,520 --> 00:30:36,320
It could be Tarik .

224
00:30:36,760 --> 00:30:40,800
But the worst part is that it 's coming from a dead man .

225
00:30:41,840 --> 00:30:44,360
Is it possible that someone is using his emails ?

226
00:30:44,440 --> 00:30:45,440
Who ?

227
00:30:46,800 --> 00:30:47,800
I don 't know .

228
00:30:49,000 --> 00:30:51,680
- The tape in my camera ... - What ?

229
00:30:53,280 --> 00:30:55,400
Never mind , I don 't think they are related .

230
00:30:56,280 --> 00:30:58,720
Let 's just drop it .

231
00:31:00,240 --> 00:31:02,400
' Cause I don 't feel good .

232
00:31:03,160 --> 00:31:05,440
CRIME SCENE - DO NOT CROSS

233
00:33:06,360 --> 00:33:07,280
Hello ?

234
00:33:07,840 --> 00:33:10,360
What happened , Haluk ? Did you get the results ?

235
00:33:10,440 --> 00:33:14,000
They were not able to get anything from the boy 's computer , Chief .

236
00:33:14,600 --> 00:33:16,800
They did not ? Why is that ?

237
00:33:35,240 --> 00:33:39,520
Those computer technicians on the force were only able to get these ?

238
00:33:39,600 --> 00:33:40,720
What is this ?

239
00:33:41,480 --> 00:33:46,160
Oddly enough , they told us this is the first time they saw such a thing .

240
00:33:46,680 --> 00:33:52,200
They didn 't find any viruses on his computer . This is all they got .

241
00:33:57,320 --> 00:34:00,680
" 388 @ 0 . "

242
00:34:15,640 --> 00:34:17,960
" 388 @ 0 . "

243
00:34:22,080 --> 00:34:23,880
Do you see what I 'm dealing with ?

244
00:34:25,320 --> 00:34:28,920
Any guess what this is talking about ?

245
00:34:42,200 --> 00:34:47,480
I 'm going out . I 'll buy bread , some eggs , and chocolates for myself .

246
00:34:47,800 --> 00:34:49,880
- Do you need something ? - No , thanks .

247
00:34:49,960 --> 00:34:51,640
Okay , see you .

248
00:35:01,720 --> 00:35:07,960
The suicide spree is taking over America right after Japan .

249
00:35:08,040 --> 00:35:14,360
News of deaths all across the country , consisting mainly of young people ,

250
00:35:14,440 --> 00:35:16,920
is taking its toll on the American population .

251
00:35:17,000 --> 00:35:19,880
Although the exact number is unknown ,

252
00:35:19,960 --> 00:35:24,560
